# Cursor Cloud branch defaults

**Effective base branch: `integration`.** Do not treat `main` as the starting branch for feature work even if the Cloud task header says `main`.

1. `git fetch origin integration && git checkout integration && git pull`
2. Branch: `feature/<#>-slug` or `fix/<#>-slug`
3. PR target: **`integration`** with `Closes #N`
4. Never merge issue work to **`main`** (use `./scripts/promote-integration.sh --flash-ok` after hardware QA)

See [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and [integration-branch.mdc](integration-branch.mdc).
